<title>HONG KONG: Asean Resources interim net down 12 pct.</title>
<headline>Asean Resources interim net down 12 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.12  vs 13.17</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.5    vs 1.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    101.18 vs 115.19</p>
<p>    Turnover		     473.21 vs 677.72</p>
<p>    Company name		 Asean Resources Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 13-17</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   February 17</p>
<p>NOTE - Asean Resources is a property investment and management company. It also manufactures leather goods.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
